  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is the orbital radius and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>&nbsp;is the orbital velocity of an electron in a hydrogen atom, then its magnetic dipole moment is"
